A/52:2018 PDF, each naming the spec table and page it came from. Its test
streams come from aften and Dolby's own published streams, and its reference
PCM from liba52, each used only as a black box. AC-3 and E-AC-3 may be subject to patent licensing in
some jurisdictions. Dolby, Dolby Digital and Dolby Digital Plus are
trademarks of Dolby Laboratories; this software is not affiliated with Dolby.

